OL,3,GNEWSAFresh call to reinstate lost rail
OL,4,Alink
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has stepped up calls for a
OL,7,FLancashire town's rail link to be
OL,8,Fbrought back into use.
OL,10,FCampaigners have fought for years to
OL,11,Freopen the Poulton to Fleetwood link,
OL,12,Fwhich has been shut since the 1970s.
OL,14,FLorraine Beavers, MP for Blackpool
OL,15,FNorth and Fleetwood, is to hold a
OL,16,Fmeeting on Thursday with community
OL,17,Fleaders, transport experts and business
OL,18,Frepresentatives to discuss how to
OL,19,Fprogress proposals to reopen the line.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
